03ci\\u003e(Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom and the rest on top in any order.)\\u003c/i\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026bull You gain 3 life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026bull Exile another target creature you own. Return it to the battlefield under your control at the beginning of the next end step.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eGem3F Vorthos\\u003c/font\\u003e scries 2 (source: \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#F0E68C\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u00273d58b20d-8748-4e29-960d-7affb84082bf\\u0027\\u003eCharming Prince\\u003c/font\\u003e [3d5])\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eGem3F Vorthos\\u003c/font\\u003e puts a card from library to the bottom of their library (source: \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#F0E68C\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u00273d58b20d-8748-4e29-960d-7affb84082bf\\u0027\\u003eCharming Prince\\u003c/font\\u003e [3d5])\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eGem3F Vorthos\\u003c/font\\u003e puts a card from library to the top of their library (source: \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#F0E68C\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u00273d58b20d-8748-4e29-960d-7affb84082bf\\u0027\\u003eCharming Prince\\u003c/font\\u003e [3d5])\\n[Chat] Gem3F Vorthos: \\u0026quot;The dragons are stirring, Analyst! This show is just beginning.\\u0026quot;\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eGem3F Vorthos\\u003c/font\\u003e attacks \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eGem25F Analyst\\u003c/font\\u003e with 2 creatures\\nAttacker: \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#F0E68C\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u002771cc7f17-6a53-40f6-b6fd-7a63c78e16a6\\u0027\\u003eMomo, Friendly Flier\\u003c/font\\u003e [71c] (1/1) unblocked\\nAttacker: \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#FF6347\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u0027cc0e5255-4c33-4d48-9ac4-c8d5782ae6de\\u0027\\u003eSarkhan, Dragon Ascendant\\u003c/font\\u003e [cc0] (2/2) unblocked\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\