      "action_taken": "Played Rockface Village as second land, leaving Sunbillow Verge unable to produce red mana.",
      "better_line": "Play Mountain to enable Sunbillow Verge's red mana ability, giving access to Lightning Helix on turn 3 to answer Momo and providing more flexible mana for Slickshot Show-Offs and future plays.",
      "type": "blunder",
