      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "The player passed their turn without playing their Mountain (missing a land drop) and without casting or plotting any of their three Slickshot Show-Offs despite having the mana to do so. This wastes an entire turn of development on turn 2, falling behind against Momo which will grow as the opponent develops their board.",
