      "decision_index": 44,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Slickshot Show-Off is a 1/2 flyer with haste that grows with noncreature spells. It's tapped and attacking, meaning the opponent already committed it. Sarkhan is a 2/2 that could block and kill the 1/2 Slickshot cleanly (assuming no pump spells). The opponent's lands are all tapped (Sunbillow Verge, Mountain, Rockface Village all tapped or one untapped), so there's limited ability to cast pump spells. Rockface Village is untapped but can only pump Lizard/Mouse/Otter/Raccoon types, not a Bird Wizard. The opponent has no untapped mana sources to cast instants like Burst Lightning or Lightning Helix to protect the Slickshot. Blocking with Sarkhan would be a clean kill on a dangerous threat with no risk given the opponent's tapped mana state.",
